(7412761, 1168539, 163081, '<td valign="top">My favorite for the red ribbon. This picture is one out of thousands. Definitely worth putting in a photographer''s portfolio. The smoothness and blending of colors makes it relaxing to look at. A 10 from me.</td>', 'My favorite for the red ribbon. This picture is one out of thousands. Definitely worth putting in a photographer''s portfolio. The smoothness and blending of colors makes it relaxing to look at. A 10 from me.', '2015-10-28 00:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412807, 1168589, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you didn''t use the full 1200px for this one.</td>', 'Not sure why you didn''t use the full 1200px for this one.', '2015-10-28 10:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412808, 1168646, 156466, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if the color noise was intentional but it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Don''t know if the color noise was intentional but it doesn''t work for me.', '2015-10-28 10:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412809, 1168596, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would love to see what this looks like in color, but it''s a great B&amp;W landscape.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Would love to see what this looks like in color, but it''s a great B&W landscape.  Nicely done.', '2015-10-28 10:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412810, 1168470, 156466, '<td valign="top">''Zat you, Rob?  Lovely composition and colors</td>', '''Zat you, Rob?  Lovely composition and colors', '2015-10-28 10:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412811, 1168632, 156466, '<td valign="top">Like it a lot - except for a few of the wisps of tall grass sneaking in at the bottom, pulling my eye away.</td>', 'Like it a lot - except for a few of the wisps of tall grass sneaking in at the bottom, pulling my eye away.', '2015-10-28 10:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412815, 1168534, 156466, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t work for me.  Dark constrasts and blown out portions of the sky feel like the processing got heavy handed.  That''s not to mention the orientation and choice of B&amp;W, which could have worked with a different treatment.</td>', 'Doesn''t work for me.  Dark constrasts and blown out portions of the sky feel like the processing got heavy handed.  That''s not to mention the orientation and choice of B&W, which could have worked with a different treatment.', '2015-10-28 10:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412824, 1168610, 156466, '<td valign="top">I really like this view, but it''s just a little over the top on the saturation. 6 that could have been a lot higher.</td>', 'I really like this view, but it''s just a little over the top on the saturation. 6 that could have been a lot higher.', '2015-10-28 11:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412825, 1168539, 156466, '<td valign="top">Many times I''ll see shots like this and just not feel them.  Not this time.  Absolutely lovely.</td>', 'Many times I''ll see shots like this and just not feel them.  Not this time.  Absolutely lovely.', '2015-10-28 11:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412826, 1168563, 156466, '<td valign="top">Feels more street than urban landscape. Like the shot but not in this challenge.</td>', 'Feels more street than urban landscape. Like the shot but not in this challenge.', '2015-10-28 11:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412827, 1168519, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m getting some banding in the sky, but otherwise lovely.</td>', 'I''m getting some banding in the sky, but otherwise lovely.', '2015-10-28 11:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412828, 1168594, 156466, '<td valign="top">A little CA or haloing on the trees at the far left but otherwise a spectacular image.</td>', 'A little CA or haloing on the trees at the far left but otherwise a spectacular image.', '2015-10-28 11:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412830, 1168555, 156466, '<td valign="top">Spectacular.  Was thinking it looks like Garden of the Gods but then I remember seeing photos of this tree at the Flatirons.  Dennis, is that you?  If so, lovely shot.</td>', 'Spectacular.  Was thinking it looks like Garden of the Gods but then I remember seeing photos of this tree at the Flatirons.  Dennis, is that you?  If so, lovely shot.', '2015-10-28 11:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412833, 1168668, 156466, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground in the B&amp;W treatment but the twigs get too intertwined and lose definition further back with the alternating light and dark colors.</td>', 'I like the foreground in the B&W treatment but the twigs get too intertwined and lose definition further back with the alternating light and dark colors.', '2015-10-28 11:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412834, 1168577, 156466, '<td valign="top">The only thing I''m not crazy about is the title.</td>', 'The only thing I''m not crazy about is the title.', '2015-10-28 11:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412835, 1168622, 156466, '<td valign="top">Yep</td>', 'Yep', '2015-10-28 11:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412836, 1168573, 156466, '<td valign="top">One of those places that you see alot here.</td>', 'One of those places that you see alot here.', '2015-10-28 11:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412837, 1168291, 156466, '<td valign="top">No ice yet? ;)  Powerful image.</td>', 'No ice yet? ;)  Powerful image.', '2015-10-28 11:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412838, 1168574, 156466, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely.  Unfortunately I find the fallen tree more distracting than leading.</td>', 'Absolutely lovely.  Unfortunately I find the fallen tree more distracting than leading.', '2015-10-28 11:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412839, 1168585, 156466, '<td valign="top">A little too white?</td>', 'A little too white?', '2015-10-28 11:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412840, 1168650, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of this treatment of a lovely scene.  You had a shooting partner to your right on the other side of that same branch?</td>', 'Not a fan of this treatment of a lovely scene.  You had a shooting partner to your right on the other side of that same branch?', '2015-10-28 11:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412841, 1168579, 156466, '<td valign="top">Idea is a bit "out there" ;)</td>', 'Idea is a bit "out there" ;)', '2015-10-28 11:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412842, 1168530, 156466, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene.  Nicely processed from a color perspective (i.e. thank you for not over-saturating), but just a little too structured for me, particularly the sky.</td>', 'Lovely scene.  Nicely processed from a color perspective (i.e. thank you for not over-saturating), but just a little too structured for me, particularly the sky.', '2015-10-28 11:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412843, 1168398, 156466, '<td valign="top">Feels like a golf course.</td>', 'Feels like a golf course.', '2015-10-28 11:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412844, 1168601, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really lovely.  Just a touch crooked on the horizon tweaking my OCD.</td>', 'Really lovely.  Just a touch crooked on the horizon tweaking my OCD.', '2015-10-28 11:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412847, 1168627, 156466, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You need a LITTLE more depth of field here as the distant trees look just out of focus. The haloing around them leads me to believe you may have done some processing to the sky (blur?) that may have affected things you didn''t want to affect. Clean that up and I suspect this would be spectacular as a metal print.</td>', 'Wow!  You need a LITTLE more depth of field here as the distant trees look just out of focus. The haloing around them leads me to believe you may have done some processing to the sky (blur?) that may have affected things you didn''t want to affect. Clean that up and I suspect this would be spectacular as a metal print.', '2015-10-28 12:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412849, 1168555, 123833, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2015-10-28 12:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412850, 1168470, 123833, '<td valign="top">Clouds over desert? Very unusual</td>', 'Clouds over desert? Very unusual', '2015-10-28 12:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412851, 1168622, 123833, '<td valign="top">Nice Blue</td>', 'Nice Blue', '2015-10-28 12:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412852, 1168577, 123833, '<td valign="top">Likely winner</td>', 'Likely winner', '2015-10-28 12:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412853, 1168569, 38032, '<td valign="top">Has a very "from an airplane window" feel to it. Dreamy. =)</td>', 'Has a very "from an airplane window" feel to it. Dreamy. =)', '2015-10-28 12:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412876, 1168563, 50641, '<td valign="top">very, very <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=13688" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">muur88</a>-like!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-11-02 04:30:57.</i></td>', 'very, very  muur88-like!', '2015-10-28 14:37:14.000000', '2015-11-02 04:30:57.000000', 1),
(7412932, 1168581, 38032, '<td valign="top">the meandering river from this viewpoint is a great guide to start the eye exploring this one.</td>', 'the meandering river from this viewpoint is a great guide to start the eye exploring this one.', '2015-10-28 22:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412933, 1168555, 38032, '<td valign="top">Great classic feel.</td>', 'Great classic feel.', '2015-10-28 22:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412945, 1168530, 2333, '<td valign="top">Love it... I have a panorama I shot from this exact vantage point in about 1998 hanging on my wall!</td>', 'Love it... I have a panorama I shot from this exact vantage point in about 1998 hanging on my wall!', '2015-10-28 22:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412966, 1168294, 38032, '<td valign="top">A lovely lively dance. Bumping to 7</td>', 'A lovely lively dance. Bumping to 7', '2015-10-28 23:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412967, 1168677, 38032, '<td valign="top">a fascinating place to see. The composition is excellent. The flowers on the right and people on the left draw me into the mix of horizontal and vertical. Love the depth as well. The bike , the mysterious doorways and shadows - all quite splendid.<br/>bump to 8. And here''s this: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167384" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png"/></a>. My top choice.</td>', 'a fascinating place to see. The composition is excellent. The flowers on the right and people on the left draw me into the mix of horizontal and vertical. Love the depth as well. The bike , the mysterious doorways and shadows - all quite splendid.bump to 8. And here''s this: . My top choice.', '2015-10-28 23:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412968, 1168651, 38032, '<td valign="top">It''s a print made from a painting at a rummage sale. Beautiful! Bumping to 8.<br/>Reminds me so much of my Gramma the painter and of Vermont and places like that.<br/>Have a red: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167385" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167385.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167385.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167385.png"/></a></td>', 'It''s a print made from a painting at a rummage sale. Beautiful! Bumping to 8.Reminds me so much of my Gramma the painter and of Vermont and places like that.Have a red: ', '2015-10-28 23:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412969, 1168627, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. I feel like it is a tad over-processed which takes a bit of the natural drama.</td>', 'This is lovely. I feel like it is a tad over-processed which takes a bit of the natural drama.', '2015-10-28 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412970, 1168530, 38032, '<td valign="top">Feels a bit soft but he composition and scene is spectacular.  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167386" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png"/></a></td>', 'Feels a bit soft but he composition and scene is spectacular.  ', '2015-10-28 23:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412971, 1168594, 30669, '<td valign="top">I love this shot</td>', 'I love this shot', '2015-10-28 23:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412972, 1168530, 30669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love how the bridge stands out in contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful! Love how the bridge stands out in contrast.', '2015-10-29 00:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412994, 1168555, 16912, '<td valign="top">Getting a sky like that above a tree like that <b>and</b> converting the image to B&amp;W is a route to a ribbon imho so good luck! (bumping 1)</td>', 'Getting a sky like that above a tree like that and converting the image to B&W is a route to a ribbon imho so good luck! (bumping 1)', '2015-10-29 08:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412995, 1168398, 16912, '<td valign="top">The thing with such a simple image is that it needs to be nigh on perfect and think you pretty much nailed this one!<br/> <br/>The movement in the tree (obviously) caused by the long exposure adds an extra dimension  here.<br/> <br/>I''m not totally convinced by the frame but it doesn''t distract me so that''s good - bumping 2.</td>', 'The thing with such a simple image is that it needs to be nigh on perfect and think you pretty much nailed this one! The movement in the tree (obviously) caused by the long exposure adds an extra dimension  here. I''m not totally convinced by the frame but it doesn''t distract me so that''s good - bumping 2.', '2015-10-29 08:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412996, 1168650, 16912, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where this was taken and whilst we get some amazing sun rises/sets here this looks a little over cooked to my eye. I''d have preferred the reds (especially in the reflection) to be a little less saturated and maybe a little more light on the foreground grasses.<br/> <br/>It looks like a fantastic spot to visit.</td>', 'I don''t know where this was taken and whilst we get some amazing sun rises/sets here this looks a little over cooked to my eye. I''d have preferred the reds (especially in the reflection) to be a little less saturated and maybe a little more light on the foreground grasses. It looks like a fantastic spot to visit.', '2015-10-29 08:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413023, 1168453, 1792, '<td valign="top">Tree seems too centered  I do like the curve in the road</td>', 'Tree seems too centered  I do like the curve in the road', '2015-10-29 12:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
