(7413208, 1168490, 149964, '<td valign="top">Clever capture. It''s almost as though there should be a reflection of the ''plane but the bird is there instead!</td>', 'Clever capture. It''s almost as though there should be a reflection of the ''plane but the bird is there instead!', '2015-10-30 16:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
