(7413633, 1168540, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Giles:</b></div><hr/><i> A 10 stop/3.0 nd filter would have uped this 2-3 points </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I appreciate the comment, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=137576" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Giles</a>.  Unfortunately, the same 10 stop that gives great motion in the skies and water renders the wind-blown trees indistinct, and not in a good way.</td>', 'Originally posted by Giles: A 10 stop/3.0 nd filter would have uped this 2-3 points   I appreciate the comment,  Giles.  Unfortunately, the same 10 stop that gives great motion in the skies and water renders the wind-blown trees indistinct, and not in a good way.', '2015-11-02 06:45:50.000000', NULL, 0),
