(7414125, 1168470, 89220, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Once again we were in Dubai, only just last week, but only for a stopover next time we''re going to check into a hotel for a least one or two nights and check out this amazing city  hopefully we will get time to go to the desert.... fantastic shot as usual! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh no! you missed again. Yes, make it next time. Please let me know if you need any help.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Once again we were in Dubai, only just last week, but only for a stopover next time we''re going to check into a hotel for a least one or two nights and check out this amazing city  hopefully we will get time to go to the desert.... fantastic shot as usual!   Oh no! you missed again. Yes, make it next time. Please let me know if you need any help.', '2015-11-04 07:12:13.000000', NULL, 0),
